---
layout: layout.njk
title: Request a Nursing Practical File
description: Need a specific nursing care plan, case study, or practical file? Submit your request for free.
---

<div class="request-premium-page" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 50px auto; padding: 0 20px;">
    <div class="request-hero" style="text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e3a5f); border-radius: 30px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <div class="hero-badge" style="display: inline-block; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.2); color: #fbbf24; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.8rem;">✨ Free Service for Nursing Students</div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: white; margin: 20px 0 15px;">Request a <span style="color: #fbbf24;">Practical File</span></h1>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">Need a specific nursing care plan, case study, health talk, or procedure? We'll create it for you — <strong>completely free</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="request-stats" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 50px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: var(--surface); padding: 20px 35px; border-radius: 60px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent);">500+</div><div class="stat-label" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">Requests Fulfilled</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: var(--surface); padding: 20px 35px; border-radius: 60px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent);">3-5</div><div class="stat-label" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">Days Delivery</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card" style="background: var(--surface); padding: 20px 35px; border-radius: 60px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent);">100%</div><div class="stat-label" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">Free Service</div></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div class="request-form-container" style="background: var(--surface); border-radius: 30px; padding: 35px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;"><h2 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">📝 Submit Your Request</h2><p>Fill out the form below. We'll create your practical file and notify you via email.</p></div>
            <form name="request-topic" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/thank-you/" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
                <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="request-topic">
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px;">
                    <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">👤 Your Full Name</label><input type="text" name="name" placeholder="e.g., Jinny" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);" required></div>
                    <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">📧 Email Address</label><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Where to send the file" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);" required></div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px;">
                    <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">🎓 Your Course</label><select name="course" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);"><option>ANM</option><option>GNM</option><option>BSc Nursing</option><option>Post Basic BSc</option></select></div>
                    <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">📂 Category</label><select name="category" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);"><option>Nursing Care Plan</option><option>Surgical Care Plan</option><option>Case Study</option><option>Health Talk</option><option>Health Education</option><option>Procedure</option><option>Assignment</option><option>Family Folder</option><option>Nursing Notes</option><option>Case Presentation</option><option>Lesson Plan</option><option>Drug Study</option><option>Nursing Diagnosis</option><option>Question Bank</option><option>Practical Exam Guide</option></select></div>
                </div>
                <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">📝 Topic / Disease Name</label><input type="text" name="topic" placeholder="e.g., Nursing Care Plan on Chronic Kidney Disease" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);" required></div>
                <div><label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">💡 Additional Details (Optional)</label><textarea name="details" rows="4" style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg);"></textarea></div>
                <button type="submit" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-light)); border: none; padding: 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: white; cursor: pointer;">🚀 Submit Request →</button>
                <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem;">⚡ No charges, no hidden fees. We're here to help nursing students succeed.</p>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px;">
            <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: 25px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><h3 style="margin-bottom: 18px;">🔥 Most Requested Topics</h3><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;"><span style="background: var(--bg); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem;">📋 Myocardial Infarction</span><span style="background: var(--bg); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem;">🩺 Diabetes Case Study</span><span style="background: var(--bg); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem;">🗣️ COVID-19 Health Talk</span><span style="background: var(--bg); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem;">❤️ Hypertension Care Plan</span></div></div>
            <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: 25px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center;"><div style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent);">"</div><p style="font-style: italic;">I requested a COPD care plan and received it within 3 days. Perfect format!</p><div style="margin-top: 10px;">— Yamini, Shital Institute of Nursing, Lunawada, Gujarat</div><div style="color: #fbbf24;">★★★★★</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
